age should be orange if above 2% and red if above 3%.\r\n   - Disparity on the screen should be orange if above eye separation and red if above both eye separation and disparity percentage conditions.\r\n   - Disparity fraction should be orange if it exceeds 1/20.", "created_at": "2024-06-05T13:09:57Z", "repo": "stereocalculator", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5f1168705f8f46a923a56f9d0e494a22b3c51575", "message": "Add files via upload", "created_at": "2024-06-04T22:14:59Z", "repo": "stereocalculator", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "563f2b6351f284e4b4b11991e7c5aa46a2142661", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2024-06-04T22:03:09Z", "repo": "stereocalculator", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7f14cfb3d8c6e5ba8fe5a1f78cec5428f496c053", "message": "Add files via upload", "created_at": "2024-06-04T21:25:20Z", "repo": "stereocalculator", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "eba56ebab1bd6c0f55aa24edbb18ef2df05efe12", "message": "Update README.md\n\nmanuial corrrected v12... and new version v13", "created_at": "2024-06-04T21:24:34Z", "repo": "stereocalculator", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c7cbad95b05353c679c0d3b409e86336ab0ef425", "message": "v9 and v10 upload\n\nv9 and v10 upload", "created_at": "2024-06-04T20:14:51Z", "repo": "stereocalculator", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "847a7d4339479b7b82ced3db0b766033f13afc7a", "message": "Update README.md\n\nv10", "created_at": "2024-06-04T20:13:57Z", "repo": "stereocalculator", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "798420223c3b238fd51761c0952ae0b38ed9ab3b", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2024-06-04T19:59:34Z", "repo": "stereocalculator", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3ac69326bd719357e1ec0f3d220ece7680bbae0e", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2024-06-02T10:26:44Z", "repo": "stereocalculator", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c35ac45f08c98125550ccba0837e5bf011b48487", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2024-06-02T10:24:51Z", "repo": "stereocalculator", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9cd89f18933f01b9bcce8b2638e39d6008964321", "message": "Create stereocalculatorv8\n\n### Explanation:\r\n- Instead of calculating the disparity on the screen as a fixed percentage of the screen width, we now calculate it as a percentage of the screen width using the correct formula: disparityCm / screenWidth.\r\n\r\n### Instructions:\r\n1. Copy the updated code above and save it as an HTML file (e.g., stereo_calculator.html).\r\n2. Open the HTML file in a web browser.\r\n3. Adjust the sliders to set the values for the interaxial base (IA), distance to the subject, far distance, lens focal length, and TV screen size.\r\n4. Observe the calculated results update in real-time as you adjust the sliders.", "created_at": "2024-06-02T10:24:28Z", "repo": "stereocalculator", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c739d0a4975626faae719059817c20abf948f5b1", "message": "Initial commit", "created_at": "2024-06-02T10:23:00Z", "repo": "stereocalculator", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}], "prs": []}